# google-services.json placeholder

Replace this file with the real Firebase Android config downloaded from:

Firebase Console → Project settings → Your apps → Android (`edu.onecampus.mobile`) → google-services.json

Save the real file as:

```
apps/mobile/google-services.json
```

That path is gitignored. See `docs/firebase-setup.md`.

EAS / local builds need the real file present (or provided as an EAS file secret).
